    "text": "Minimum standards for the citizens of Sri Lanka engaged in fishing operations in foreign flagged fishing boatsRegulations published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1945/7 of December 14, 2015 are hereby amended by theaddition immediately after regulation 6 thereof of the following regulation :-",
